WEBVTT

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:06.150
Okay, the transplant is almost complete.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:10.030
Narumi's body now carries
the aspirations of everybody.

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.110
Yeah, but...

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.370
Is this even Minghai anymore?

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.240
All his limbs are marionette parts.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.370
Mingxia.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.620
Narumi is Narumi.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.420
I'm almost done.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.550
Pantalone got me. But I can still do this.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.550
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:38.640
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:43.190
And the gears turn

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.280
When the horn blows, the flames dance

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:59.160
The story waits for no-one

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:02.040
Off they go, the gears are churning

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:05.290
A red past chases after you

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:07.630
The jester's smile

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:10.510
What's behind the mask?

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:13.340
You can't erase the scars

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:16.220
No matter how they burn

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:19.060
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:22.100
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:27.770
Alone in the depths of the night

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.980
Let out a cry that can cut through fate

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:34.530
That's the cue to begin

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:38.160
The curtain is rising, it's time to dance

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:42.200
Everybody sheds tears at the end

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:45.160
So hold them in now and keep going

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:49.920
Until the day the curtain falls

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:55.260
The gears will keep turning

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:05.520
#14 By the sea, in the dead of night

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:09.520
It's all gone quiet.

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:12.900
Seems like those low-grade automata
have been wiped out.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:16.950
Damn you, Colombine.

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:21.120
I'll end this,
even if I have to do it on my own.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:24.250
He's going to...

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.040
Hurry, we must move now!

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:31.290
Move body, move!

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:36.760
Lady Francine didn't tell me to bow down.
She never did!

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:41.010
This is not Lady Francine!

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:46.430
I came here to protect my family
from ZONAPHA syndrome.

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:50.020
And Narumi gave me hope.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:53.770
With a man like him,
we can overcome ZONAPHA.

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:55.650
I can die at peace.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.820
Let me.

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.490
No way.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:08.250
Narumi told me that
not everything needs a reason.

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:17.510
One last stitch.

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:21.550
Just one last stitch.

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:32.270
How beautiful humans are...

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:49.120
This is not Lady Francine!

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:57.210
They're moving! I've got to stop them.

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:18.440
The imposter is no more!

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:21.240
We are free again. We win!

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:22.700
Not so fast!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:35.210
What's this? Another measly human?

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:39.300
Out of my way.

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:56.730
Wake up, Minghai.

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:59.190
The surgery is over.

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.320
Everybody's dead.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:03.530
You're our only hope.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:10.120
Hey, what do you think you're doing?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:15.120
Forgive me, but now I am ready to go.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.210
You don't mean...

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:21.260
Yes, to attack Doll Francine.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:25.590
That way, the automata will come after me.
You'll be safe here.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.430
You can't, Fatima.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:31.390
It's fine.
How else could we save Narumi?

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:35.940
Who thought I'd ever feel like this?

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.690
-I guess I'm not a shirogane anymore.
-Wait!

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:40.940
Thank you, Mingxia.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:43.570
Tell Narumi to take care.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:48.820
Forgive us.

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:53.830
We followed the orders of an imposter.

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.580
This will never happen again.

00:05:57.380 --> 00:06:00.170
We are loyal only to you, Lady Francine.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.090
Fight me!

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.680
Who do you think you are?

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:08.050
Wake up, Minghai!

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.970
Don't let everybody's sacrifices
go to waste.

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:13.560
It's now or never.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:16.060
Come on, Minghai.

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:18.310
Get up.

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:26.610
You think that'll work on us?

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:29.370
Woah, now.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.870
How would you like to dance
in a rain of fire?

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.670
I never told you this.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.800
I liked the way you stood.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:48.380
I wish I could see it one last time.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:15.240
Minghai!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:19.290
Your body... It's...

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:22.460
I know. I heard everything.

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.710
These aren't marionette limbs.

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.470
They're the souls of our friends!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.930
Then use them to stop the automata.

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:35.310
And save Fatima too.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.060
Leave it to me.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.070
I told you.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:01.330
Narumi...

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:10.340
Die in front of your friend.

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:26.570
I'm so glad...

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:28.690
You're alive.

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:32.910
Yeah, we've got a lot to catch up on.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:38.410
But first, I have to crush those two
and Doll Francine.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:41.040
Yes, you have to win.

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:48.050
How dare you punch my face,
you lowly human!

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:50.300
One second till death!

00:08:55.390 --> 00:08:57.350
My foot...

00:08:59.220 --> 00:08:59.970
He's fast.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.480
Impossible...

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.900
I'm Pantalone, the strongest puppet ever!

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:12.900
Automata will never lose to a human!

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:16.870
You've only existed for 200 years.
You call that undefeated?

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:22.330
Humans have studied the art of combat
for 10 times longer than that!

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:36.930
Wow.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:39.310
Minghai.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:41.810
Goodnight, Pantalone.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:45.770
It's getting well past "midnight"
for this "circus."

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:49.190
Time for you to go to sleep, Arlequino.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:52.690
Dear me. I'm disappointed in you.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:59.280
You were a human who dared challenge us
using only martial arts.

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.910
I even respected you.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:06.210
No matter how much humans learn,
they die in the end.

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:10.000
That is the beauty of the fleeting lives
of humans.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:12.840
But look at you now.

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:16.470
You can hardly call yourself human.

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.310
Let me purify you.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:23.220
Narumi!

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:27.480
You're wrong.

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:31.860
Humans aren't beautiful because we die.

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:34.610
It's because even in the face of death...

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:38.860
we can smile a great big smile.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:53.550
Impossible...!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:01.430
We're almost there...

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:07.810
I got to do what I wanted to do.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.110
I am fulfilled.

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:24.370
Now.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:27.330
All your puppets are gone.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:31.710
This is the end for automata
and ZONAPHA syndrome.

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:38.510
You there human,
this is the first time we meet.

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:40.090
Yeah.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:42.010
And now, goodbye.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:45.430
This is for everyone!

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:47.520
It's finally the end...

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:52.900
I was created in 1909 by Lady Francine.

00:11:58.740 --> 00:12:01.780
What did you just say?

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:04.410
Don't lie.

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:06.580
I still remember.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:08.910
The day I was created.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:13.580
Open your eyes.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:21.930
Your name will be Francine.

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:27.680
Yes, my name is Francine.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:32.060
I have traveled for almost 100 years now.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.980
I have led this Midnight Circus.

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:39.150
But I am tired now.

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:42.990
I am going to disappear from this world.

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.580
I do not understand. Why?

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:49.240
You will understand someday.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:53.960
But the other puppets
will be severely perplexed.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.630
That is why you must replace me.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:03.300
Be their leader. Love them, praise them.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:05.590
I will.

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:09.520
But how do you plan
to make yourself disappear?

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:13.270
The shirogane's puppets,

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:17.520
they're all created by a group of
puppet makers in the East.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.780
They will know.

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:23.320
Or rather,
I am interested in meeting them.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:30.120
I may be able to understand
what my creator was feeling.

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:35.080
I am counting on you.

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.880
And so, she left.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.210
That is how I replaced Francine.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.130
I am not her.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:47.760
And ZONAPHA?

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:50.810
It won't be gone even if I destroy you?

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:54.310
No, only she can do that.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:57.810
Where is the real Francine?

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:02.570
I understand now
how Lady Francine felt that day.

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:06.030
We cannot be humans.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:10.740
So to travel with puppets
who try to make us laugh...

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:14.830
It is very... tiring...

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:19.130
That is why...

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:21.880
I am now...

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.340
relieved...

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:27.720
Answer me! Where is Francine!

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:40.480
You mean, this was all for nothing?

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:48.660
"PRAYING FOR VICTORY,
ANGELINA SAIGA"

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:55.620
Where can he be now?

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.580
I should've kept a closer eye
on Mr. Masaru.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:02.380
Did he ever ask you to?

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:05.920
No, but I must protect him.

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:08.510
Listen well.

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:14.100
A time comes for every boy when he
wants to accomplish something by himself.

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:17.100
What is that something?

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:19.350
There's no need for you to know.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:24.190
All you must know is that there is love
in not protecting someone.

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:26.990
Love in not protecting?

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:31.990
Let's go home.
The ocean breeze is cold tonight.

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:36.450
I don't understand.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.290
What would Narumi do?

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:57.220
Narumi!

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:03.440
You... You're Narumi Kato.

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:08.440
I'm so glad you're alive.

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.990
Arlequin's Blade of Saint George.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.200
Narumi, your body!

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:22.120
This is a symbol of what I've fought for.

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:25.290
A symbol of the strong ties
with my friends.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:28.550
A symbol that makes me who I am.

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:32.220
You're Narumi, aren't you?
Why do you attack me?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:35.140
Yes, that is my name.

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:38.220
Why does the leader of the automata
know my name?

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:41.480
You are the true Doll Francine!

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:45.940
What did you say?

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:47.480
Don't play dumb!

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:53.070
You even move like a human.

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:55.990
Not like the fake one
I destroyed in the Sahara.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:59.290
Why does Narumi know about the automata?

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:02.250
And why does he think I'm Doll Francine?

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:06.250
Narumi, it's me, Shirogane.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:10.510
You protected me.
You taught me how to smile.

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:13.760
I'm not the Francine doll.
I'm Éléonore!

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:17.930
Éléonore, you say?

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:19.890
I don't know you.

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:23.890
We've never met before.

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:27.400
Now, tell me how to cure
ZONAPHA syndrome.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:33.400
Look, I'm bleeding. I'm human!

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:35.780
That's no proof.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:41.120
You know how to create synthetic blood.

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.540
I know all about it.

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:45.580
And I know that you're Francine!

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:50.960
I don't mind being killed if it's by you.

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:53.720
But not while you misunderstand me.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:55.090
Who told you such a lie?

00:17:57.010 --> 00:18:01.970
A few days ago, the shiroganes and the
automata fought a final battle.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:05.350
But the Francine doll I destroyed
was just a decoy.

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:10.150
During my quest to find the real one,
a certain man came to me.

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:11.570
A certain man?

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:15.860
A survivor of Clogue Village in Quiberon,
the village you ravaged.

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:23.500
Too bad about the war
with the Midnight Circus, Narumi.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:30.540
Not even I realized
that was not the real Doll Francine.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.000
Who are you?

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:35.550
The head of Fou Industries.

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:37.760
I'm Fou, a former shirogane.

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:41.850
F-O-U. It's French for "fool."

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:47.730
I'm a fool who has given up
being a shirogane to be in the audience.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:52.150
Audiences want to know everything.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:54.730
I use my Eye-sect robots.

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.570
They're nano-sized
camera-equipped automata.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:00.320
I attached them to all the shiroganes.

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:02.780
So I could watch what went on.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:06.830
I quit being one of the actors,

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:11.080
but I need to know how this tragedy ends.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.590
So you just sat and did nothing?

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:16.340
When all the shiroganes
fought with their lives.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:20.640
Yes, but I'm not just
an ordinary spectator.

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:24.010
I chose a path different from Lucille
and the others.

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:27.350
The path of research and business.

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:32.110
Shiroganes age 5 times slower
than normal people.

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:36.110
I was able to succeed as a researcher
and build a fortune.

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:41.240
Thanks to this, I've been able
to amply aid the shiroganes.

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:47.120
Do you understand? The audience is god.

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:51.040
If what you're saying is true,
then tell me.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:53.960
Where is the real Doll Francine?

00:19:55.500 --> 00:20:00.510
She goes by the name Shirogane Saiga.
Her real name is Éléonore now.

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:03.220
She's in a small circus in Japan.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:09.640
You became a shirogane when you were young
using Aqua Vitae,

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:13.900
but Doll Francine had melted
into that Aqua Vitae.

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:16.940
Everything that was her became you.

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:19.110
You are her reincarnation.

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:23.320
No... I don't know anything.
I really don't.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:26.160
Now tell me.

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:29.410
How do you cure ZONAPHA syndrome?

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:38.550
Such heavy feelings are
emanating from him.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:44.090
So much sadder and greater
than just distress.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:50.310
Narumi, you taught me how to smile.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:52.390
You taught me how to live.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:56.230
My life was given to me by you.

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:58.570
Shut your nonsense crap.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.820
I want to ease his burden.

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:05.570
I don't care anymore
if he still misunderstands me.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:11.580
I don't mind being killed if it's by you.

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:14.170
Go on. Kill me.

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:17.340
Tell me first how to cure ZONAPHA!

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:22.300
I don't know! The only thing I can do
is die for you.

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:25.840
Now, do it. Cut my head off.

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:29.850
Anything to make your load lighter.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.100
You're being defiant? So be it.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:37.810
Then die! To stop the spread of ZONAPHA.

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:40.400
And for the shiroganes who died for this!

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:01.550
Narumi?

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:09.600
Narumi!

00:22:27.450 --> 00:22:31.870
Avoiding the crowds, I walk in the dark

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:36.920
And wait with bated breath in the wings

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:41.500
My expression is calm
while I scream inside

00:22:41.670 --> 00:22:46.470
On the verge of being torn apart

00:22:46.630 --> 00:22:51.260
I dance and beckon you to join me

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:56.140
As a shadow swings across the stage

00:22:56.310 --> 00:22:59.150
I tell myself this is the last time

00:22:59.310 --> 00:23:05.150
But I can't seem to cut myself free

00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:09.910
Too scared to stop for a moment

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:15.290
My impatience hides
the cries of somebody left behind

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:23.550
Nobody notices the shadow
standing in the sudden rain

00:23:23.710 --> 00:23:31.640
Somewhere far away,
a memory of you is saying goodbye

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:38.940
I stand here watching,
no longer able to reach you
